{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "A few quick choices first. Everything here can be changed later in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先做几个快速选择，之后都可以在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new look, PS4 games, and hundreds more Android games.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全新外观、PS4 游戏，以及数百款新增 Android 游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ANDROID": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ANDROID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APKs install from the Library's + button or from the Files tab. ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 可从游戏库的 + 按钮或“文件”页安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ATTEMPT LOG": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent Colour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强调色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Repositories": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用的软件源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Download": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Source": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加软件源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Game or App": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加游戏或应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a link to an APK or a file, or the address a computer gives you when it shares a folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴一个 APK 或文件的链接，或同一 Wi‑Fi 下电脑共享文件夹时显示的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Husk": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加到 BetterHusk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your first game": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加你的第一款游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载一个声音设备。挂载期间 Android 无法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次下载会多约 2 GB。该快照录制于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After playing, once per game per update": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游玩后，每个游戏每次更新一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An APK is added to your library when it finishes. Anything else goes into the Shared Storage folder, which games see as their phone storage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 下载完成后会加入游戏库；其他文件会进入共享存储文件夹，游戏会把它当作手机存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android App Info": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 应用信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Emulator": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 模拟器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and PS4 games, on your iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你的 iPhone 上运行 Android 和 PS4 游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and Translation Layer games need JIT. StikJIT, built into Husk, turns it on without a computer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 与翻译层游戏都需要 JIT。BetterHusk 内置的 StikJIT 无需电脑即可开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android installs it from where it already is — nothing is copied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 直接从文件原位置安装，不会复制任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 通过一块虚拟网卡访问互联网，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 为全量模拟运行，比翻译层上的游戏更慢。请用于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android will boot from cold once, then save a new one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 将冷启动一次，然后保存一个新快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 原生代码对处理器和内存有特定要求，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another game is already loaded": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有其他游戏在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Icon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Info": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps and games open in a window you can move, resize and minimise to a dock, like LiveContainer's multitasking. ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用和游戏会在可移动、可缩放、可最小化到 Dock 的窗口中打开，类似 LiveContainer 的多任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask How Games Ran": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "询问游戏运行情况"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask about Android updates": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "询问 Android 更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach my log": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附上我的日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach the sound device": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挂载声音设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic follows the system appearance — light, dark and tinted. The others pin ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“自动”跟随系统外观——浅色、深色与着色；其他选项则固定为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic offers the controller for games that cannot be played without one (Unreal Engine games), when no real ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当没有真实手柄时，为必须使用手柄的游戏（虚幻引擎游戏）自动提供虚拟手柄，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back Up Saves": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份存档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to Husk": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回 BetterHusk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boots the guest as soon as Husk opens, when JIT is available.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JIT 可用时，BetterHusk 一打开就启动 Android 系统。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both sides must be between 240 and 2560.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "宽和高都必须介于 240 与 2560 之间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browse Files": {
