    "Drag a control to move it, or tap one to resize or hide it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动控件可移动位置，点按可调整大小或隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app is played once JIT is on, watched for 15 seconds, and written down; then Husk closes. Open Husk again for the next one. At the end the results file is offered to share.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
