    "System follows the phone: light by day, dark by night. The guest's own ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“跟随系统”与手机一致：白天浅色、夜晚深色。客户系统自己的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap with three fingers to show the interface": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三指轻点显示界面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical Details": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "技术详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical detail in the Android Translation Layer screens: ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 翻译层界面中的技术细节："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tested by the Husk team on an iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由 Husk 团队在 iPhone 上实测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end of the log from the last time the game started. Share it when reporting a problem.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏上次启动的日志末尾。反馈问题时请附上它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game and everything it saved here are deleted from Husk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏及其在 BetterHusk 中保存的全部内容都会被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏启动时界面完全隐藏：没有工具栏、手柄或性能显示。三指同时轻点可唤出，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game stopped": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表会写入磁盘，因此在 Android"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对文件保存在 BetterHusk 的 Documents 文件夹中，只会发送给 BetterHusk 自带的助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该面板在机器启动时构建，因此修改需要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整计划见 BetterHusk 源码中的 docs/04-translation-layer.md。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告包含那次运行的完整日志、设备与构建信息。除非你主动分享，否则不会发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This APK has no 64-bit code Husk can run, so it will probably not start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 APK 不含 BetterHusk 可运行的 64 位代码，很可能无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此安装在后台最多只能等待约 30 秒，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is Geode's Android launcher. On Husk, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Geode 的 Android 启动器。在 BetterHusk 上，Geode 改为在 Geometry Dash 内运行：在此开启，"
